WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.030
- "Modern Family" ended last year

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:05.610
after 11 seasons and 22 Emmys.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.800
That's amazing!
(audience clapping)

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.180
Do y'all, and I imagine after that

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.500
many seasons of being around each other

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.990
especially growing up around them,

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.850
do y'all keep in touch?

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.092
- We do, we have a group chat.

00:00:16.092 --> 00:00:20.230
I actually just, I FaceTimed
Ed and we, Ed O'Neill,

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:23.640
and we FaceTimed for like an hour,

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.860
at least an hour around my birthday

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.000
and it was just so sweet.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.730
He's so funny everyone.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.870
We like to keep in touch.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.440
I'm probably the most
annoying person on it

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.210
'cause I'm, I have a confession.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.640
I'm a Multi texter.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.010
- Oh, me too.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.460
Yeah, ear me on the voice coach text.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.293
Yep.

00:00:41.293 --> 00:00:43.050
We have a text game, the voice coaches.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.160
It doesn't matter what season it is.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.670
Whatever coaches are involved.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:49.140
I'm the one that's like blue, blue, blue

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.769
and then there's like one
gray, blue, blue, blue.

00:00:51.769 --> 00:00:53.041
(laughing)

00:00:53.041 --> 00:00:53.874
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:53.874 --> 00:00:55.400
It's just like my thoughts.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.360
I type as I think so.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.140
- Me too.
- I'm so sorry for that,

00:00:59.140 --> 00:00:59.973
it bugs me.

00:00:59.973 --> 00:01:02.200
I just, I just don't have a filter.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.400
- Yeah, no me, me neither.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.070
I know, well somebody
has got, gotta be us.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:06.590
Let's might as well be us.

